# `datetime_diff` in nanoseconds overflowing `long` is DS4003.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| project d = datetime_diff('nanosecond', datetime(2500-01-01), datetime(1900-01-01))
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `datetime_diff` does not fit in a `long`
  --> query:3:15
  |
3 | | project d = datetime_diff('nanosecond', datetime(2500-01-01), datetime(1900-01-01))
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: a `long` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
